      "question": "How do you ask 'what is your name?' informally in Tamil?",
      "options": ["vanakkam", "onga per enna", "eppadi irukeenga", "nandri"],
      "correctIndex": 1,
      "explanation": "'Onga per enna' = what is your name — onga = your, per = name, enna = what."
    },
    {
      "id": "ta-s1-l2-ex02",
